sequenceDiagram
    %% SD1 - Set up a game
    %% Stories: 1, 2, 27, 28
    %% Description: The moderator creates a game, chooses the card deck and gets the invitation URL to share with the estimators.
    actor M as Moderator
    participant G as Game
    participant C as Card

    M->>G: create game with name and optional description [1]
    M->>G: choose deck: modified Fibonacci or powers of 2 [27]
    G->>C: createCards(deck)
    M->>G: ask for the invitation URL [2]
    G-->>M: invitation URL
    Note over M,G: the moderator shares the URL with up to 15 estimators [28]
